<!--tyo108.gate.nec.co.jp(202.247.6.8)-->4/2 Paladin List ----<BR><BR><BR><BR>A. Paladin List(1F Item)<BR>1)Wclick(1HB,2HS)<BR>2)Gonzaemon(Shield) wish発動まであと Active 2Days .<BR>3)Octavia (2HS) wish 発動までActive 3Days.<BR>4)Mals (1HB, 2HS, Legs, Shield) &lt;New Comer 4/2&gt;<BR><BR>&lt;Wish&gt; Nothing<BR><BR>B.Epic List<BR>1)Starwolf<BR>2)Mals  &lt;New Comer 4/2&gt;<BR><BR>C.Corrupter of Life　Loot List<BR>1)Octavia(Tunare)<BR>2)Starwolf(Tunare) <BR>3)Gonzaemon(Tunare)<BR><BR>D.Paladin List(2F Item):<BR>*)Octavia<BR>*)Wclick<BR>*)Yousuke<BR>*)Starwolf<BR>*)Gonzaemon<BR>*)Mals<BR><BR>&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;Absence&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;<BR>If you cannot attend the raid, let the listkeeper know prior to your day of absence or write at the bulletin board to announce your absence, please.　X(<BR>And There is no penalty for the lateness and Absence Now, But your list position will be kept while your absence.<BR><BR><BR><BR>A. Paladin List(1F Item)*1<BR>There is a list to item drops from mobs living at the 1st floor.<BR>The person on the highest position, among those on the list who do not have the item, is given the right to loot when an item drops, then moves down to the bottom. <BR>You are not allowed to "pass" on the item you don't own.<BR>You are not allowed to give out your right to loot a item to someone else. <BR>&lt;Last one wish&gt;<BR>You can declare your "last one wish". Your "wish" will become effective on the third raid day after you reache the "last one" status.<BR><BR><BR>B.Epic List<BR>There is a list for Epic(Fiery Defender）<BR><BR><BR>C.Corrupter of Life　Loot List(Only Tunare) <BR>There is a list for Natures Defenders Quest Item<BR><BR><BR>D.Paladin List(2F Item):<BR>There is a list to item drops from mobs living at the 2nd floor.<BR>it will be rolled to determine the right to loot. If you got a 2nd floors item, then you can not roll for these items untill next week or all members of this list loot any 2nd floors item . <BR><BR><BR>*The new comers of the raid will be added to the bottom of the list on their first attendance to the raid. <BR>If there are more than one players to be added, then it will be rolled to determine the order.<BR><BR><BR>thank you for reading.<BR><BR>
